        <div class="ncm-workbench__guide-grid">
          <div><strong>추가 피해</strong><p>이미 있는 공격에 화염 2d6 같은 피해만 더할 때 사용합니다. 사거리와 대상은 기존 액티비티를 그대로 사용합니다.</p></div>
          <div><strong>회복 효과</strong><p>새로운 치유 또는 임시 체력 회복 행동을 만들 때 사용합니다.</p></div>
          <div><strong>내성 공격</strong><p>민첩 내성 난이도 17, 실패 시 7d6 화염처럼 내성 굴림으로 처리하는 공격을 만들 때 사용합니다.</p></div>
          <div><strong>상태 효과</strong><p>중독·넘어짐 등 상태를 선택 액티비티에 연결할 때 사용합니다.</p></div>
        </div>
        <p class="ncm-workbench__advanced-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> 고급 액티비티 설정은 D&D5e/Midi-QOL의 특수 필드나 드문 자동화가 필요할 때만 사용하십시오. 일반적인 추가 작업에는 필요하지 않습니다.</p>
      </details>

      {{#if selected.hasAdvancementSystem}}
      <details class="ncm-workbench__card ncm-workbench__collapsible" data-section-key="advancement" open>
        <summary><strong>성장</strong></summary>
        {{#if selected.advancementTypeOptions.length}}
        <details class="ncm-workbench__subsection ncm-workbench__collapsible" data-section-key="advancement.create" open>
          <summary><strong>성장 항목 생성</strong></summary>
          <div class="ncm-workbench__activity-create">
            <select name="newAdvancementType">{{#each selected.advancementTypeOptions}}<option value="{{value}}">{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
            <input type="text" name="newAdvancementTitle" placeholder="새 성장 제목 (선택)">
            <button type="button" data-action="createAdvancement"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> 생성</button>
          </div>
        </details>
        {{/if}}
        <details class="ncm-workbench__subsection ncm-workbench__collapsible" data-section-key="advancement.list" open>
          <summary><strong>성장 항목 목록</strong></summary>
          <div class="ncm-workbench__activity-list">
            {{#each selected.advancements}}
            <button type="button" data-action="selectAdvancement" data-advancement-id="{{id}}" class="ncm-workbench__activity-select {{#if selected}}is-selected{{/if}}">
              {{#if icon}}<img src="{{icon}}" alt="">{{/if}}<span>{{title}}<small>{{typeLabel}}{{#if level}} · 레벨 {{level}}{{/if}}</small></span>
            </button>
            {{else}}<p class="ncm-workbench__muted">성장 항목이 없습니다.</p>{{/each}}
          </div>
        </details>
        {{#if selected.selectedAdvancement}}
        <details class="ncm-workbench__subsection ncm-workbench__collapsible" data-section-key="advancement.manage" open>
          <summary><strong>선택 성장 항목 관리</strong></summary>
          <div class="ncm-workbench__activity-manage">
            <button type="button" data-action="duplicateAdvancement"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> 복제</button>
            <button type="button" data-action="openAdvancementAdvanced"><i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square"></i> 전체 성장 설정</button>
            <button type="button" data-action="deleteAdvancement" class="danger"><i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i> 삭제</button>
          </div>
        </details>
        {{#each selected.advancementFieldGroups}}
        <details class="ncm-workbench__subsection ncm-workbench__collapsible" data-section-key="advancement.{{key}}" open>
          <summary><strong>{{label}}</strong></summary>
          <div class="ncm-workbench__type-field-grid">
            {{#each fields}}
            {{#if isComplex}}
            <div class="ncm-workbench__type-field is-json" data-advancement-complex-root>
              <strong>{{label}}</strong>
              <input type="hidden" data-advancement-field data-advancement-path="{{path}}" value="{{value}}">
              {{> advancementCompoundNode editor}}
            </div>
            {{else}}
            <label class="ncm-workbench__type-field {{#if isJson}}is-json{{/if}} {{#if isLongText}}is-json{{/if}}">
              <span>{{label}}</span>
              {{#if hasChoices}}
              <select data-advancement-field data-advancement-path="{{path}}">{{#each options}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
              {{else}}
                {{#if isBoolean}}<input type="checkbox" data-advancement-field data-advancement-path="{{path}}" {{#if value}}checked{{/if}}>{{/if}}
                {{#if isNumber}}<input type="number" step="{{step}}" {{#if hasMin}}min="{{min}}"{{/if}} data-advancement-field data-advancement-path="{{path}}" value="{{value}}">{{/if}}
                {{#if isText}}{{#if isLongText}}<textarea rows="3" data-advancement-field data-advancement-path="{{path}}">{{value}}</textarea>{{else}}<input type="text" {{#if isReference}}list="{{referenceList}}"{{/if}} data-advancement-field data-advancement-path="{{path}}" value="{{value}}">{{/if}}{{/if}}
                {{#if isJson}}<textarea rows="3" data-advancement-field data-advancement-path="{{path}}">{{value}}</textarea>{{/if}}
              {{/if}}
              {{#if isReference}}<datalist id="{{referenceList}}">{{#each options}}<option value="{{value}}">{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</datalist><small>아이템 참조를 선택하거나 입력합니다.</small>{{/if}}
            </label>
            {{/if}}
            {{/each}}
          </div>
        </details>
        {{/each}}
        {{/if}}
      </details>
      {{/if}}

